Found via the minilang-to-Groovy regression audit (OFBIZ-13523). Three further regressions on top of the prior fixes (OFBIZ-13568, OFBIZ-13580).

h3. 1. {{updatePortletSeqDragDrop()}} calls the ownership check before the field it depends on is set
{code:java}
Map checkIsOwner = checkOwnerShip()
if (ServiceUtil.isError(checkIsOwner)) { return checkIsOwner }
