{code}
{{checkOwnerShip()}} reads {{parameters.portalPageId}}, populated only on the next line. Servicedef only declares {{o_portalPageId}}, so the field is always empty when the check runs — {{checkOwnerShip()}} returns an empty, non-error map on empty {{portalPageId}}, so the ownership/{{MYPORTALBASE_ADMIN}} restriction never takes effect. Mini-lang set the field before calling the check. Fix: reorder.

